# corpus/bound-actions
profile own
summary make take direct
scope.begin first
call.enter factory make
new r R
new owner O resource=r
bound action owner
call.exit factory action
bind action_bind action
check ''
use action
check ''
scope.end first
check OR
reset.log
scope.begin second
new r2 R
new owner2 O resource=r2
bind owner_bind owner2
scope.begin inner
bound action2 owner2
use action2
scope.end inner
check ''
use owner2
scope.end second
check OR
